(7256875, 1128212, 60173, '<td valign="top">The horizon seems slightly tilted, but otherwise, this is great. I appreciate the somewhat muted tones. I also like that you didn''t lighten up the bottom of the image where the geese are. They''re not the subject here; they''re merely observers.</td>', 'The horizon seems slightly tilted, but otherwise, this is great. I appreciate the somewhat muted tones. I also like that you didn''t lighten up the bottom of the image where the geese are. They''re not the subject here; they''re merely observers.', '2014-08-30 16:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
