(7256899, 1128230, 177322, '<td valign="top">Gaia.  Perfect.  When first I saw this entry, my thought was, "What was the photographer thinking?"  But you know what?  THIS image is the one that stuck in my mind, so I had to come back to say: subsequently, I have become genuinely impressed with your interpretation of this assignment and wish you good fortune in placing in this challenge.  Even if you don''t place - what a lovely portrait of this matron, matriarch, best mate and soul mate. Someone is a very lucky fellow.</td>', 'Gaia.  Perfect.  When first I saw this entry, my thought was, "What was the photographer thinking?"  But you know what?  THIS image is the one that stuck in my mind, so I had to come back to say: subsequently, I have become genuinely impressed with your interpretation of this assignment and wish you good fortune in placing in this challenge.  Even if you don''t place - what a lovely portrait of this matron, matriarch, best mate and soul mate. Someone is a very lucky fellow.', '2014-08-30 23:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
