(7259272, 1128412, 43463, '<td valign="top">It is that golden glow upon the fields that turns this good photo into a spectacular, magic one. Congrats on getting such a fantastic shot Mak.</td>', 'It is that golden glow upon the fields that turns this good photo into a spectacular, magic one. Congrats on getting such a fantastic shot Mak.', '2014-09-05 09:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
