(7259275, 1128212, 43463, '<td valign="top">Glad that this captured the Blue. The scene captures the warmth and elegant beauty of the enjoying a moment of Earth''s natural charms - from the beautiful warm colors of the sky to the lovely reflections upon the lake to the elegance of the creatures basking on the shore. Congrats on such a wonderful capture.</td>', 'Glad that this captured the Blue. The scene captures the warmth and elegant beauty of the enjoying a moment of Earth''s natural charms - from the beautiful warm colors of the sky to the lovely reflections upon the lake to the elegance of the creatures basking on the shore. Congrats on such a wonderful capture.', '2014-09-05 09:13:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7259280, 1128230, 43463, '<td valign="top">For the record I gave this an 8 - there are the technicals (lighting, composition, focus) that are very well done, but it is the recognition of the beauty of a woman. A special someone close to you that you love, that makes a statement of a very human emotion - love. And it affirms that you don''t have to be a super-model to be beautiful.</td>', 'For the record I gave this an 8 - there are the technicals (lighting, composition, focus) that are very well done, but it is the recognition of the beauty of a woman. A special someone close to you that you love, that makes a statement of a very human emotion - love. And it affirms that you don''t have to be a super-model to be beautiful.', '2014-09-05 09:22:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7259282, 1128206, 138253, '<td valign="top">Thanks Don, i was hoping this would score higher, i guess the masses decided that only landscapes and currently living species are worth preserving, and the fact that we have been able to discover so much about those who came before us, while speaking to our own desire for knowledge, does not merit value in a time capsule about the planet (despite the fact the dinosaurs inhabited it far longer than we have!) :p<br/> <br/>---<br/> <br/>for the record, would the people who voted this between a 1 and a 3 please stand up and take a bow, and let me know specifically what about the entry irked you so much? I have no intention of backlash or retribution, i just truly want to know what about this image you found so heinous.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-09-05 08:30:34.</i></td>', 'Thanks Don, i was hoping this would score higher, i guess the masses decided that only landscapes and currently living species are worth preserving, and the fact that we have been able to discover so much about those who came before us, while speaking to our own desire for knowledge, does not merit value in a time capsule about the planet (despite the fact the dinosaurs inhabited it far longer than we have!) :p --- for the record, would the people who voted this between a 1 and a 3 please stand up and take a bow, and let me know specifically what about the entry irked you so much? I have no intention of backlash or retribution, i just truly want to know what about this image you found so heinous.', '2014-09-05 09:28:23.000000', '2014-09-05 09:30:34.000000', 0),
